        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Albums: All That Led Us Here, The Invisible, My Animal, Rispah\n- Events: album releases, European tour, Mercury Prize nomination, iTunes critics choice\n\nFacts:\n- Boy Hits Car released their debut album, My Animal, in 1998.\n- The Invisible released their self-titled debut album, The Invisible, on 9 March 2009.\n- The Invisible's debut album, The Invisible, was nominated for the Mercury Prize.\n- The Invisible's debut album, The Invisible, was selected as iTunes critics choice for album of the year.\n- Rispah is the second album by the English band The Invisible.\n- Boy Hits Car released their fifth studio album, All That Led Us Here, in May 2014.\n- Boy Hits Car followed the release of All That Led Us Here with a European tour.",
